# Arm: grok — Grok 4.5 via OpenRouter.
# Paste into this Mac's credentials.env (replaces the model block).
# VERIFIED 2026-08-06 against the live OpenRouter models API
# (GET https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models): slug x-ai/grok-4.5,
# context_length 500,000, max_completion_tokens undeclared (null).
#
# No MODEL_CONTEXT/MODEL_OUTPUT on purpose: the route declares no output cap,
# OpenCode's limit config requires both fields, and we prefer OpenCode's
# defaults over an invented number. Note the 500K window is the smallest in
# the fleet — if this arm hits context errors mid-run, this is where to look.
FB_ARM="grok"
MODEL_ID="x-ai/grok-4.5"
MODEL_UPSTREAM_URL="https://openrouter.ai/api/v1"
# ISOLATION: mint a DEDICATED OpenRouter key for this arm with its own credit
# limit. Never reuse the kimi arm's key — shared spend breaks per-arm billing
# caps (checklist 4.14) and arm isolation.
MODEL_API_KEY=""   # per-arm OpenRouter key
MODEL_NPM="@ai-sdk/openai-compatible"
